            konzultaci si ujasníme možnosti a&nbsp;další postup.
          </p>

          <p class="hyp-closing__support">Přibližně 30 minut · Ostrava-Poruba nebo online</p>

          <div class="hyp-closing__actions">
            <a class="hyp-cta hyp-cta--dark" href="/#kontakt">Nezávazná konzultace</a>
            <a class="hyp-phone hyp-phone--dark" href="tel:+420775217721">
              <svg class="hyp-phone__icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
                <path
                  d="M6.5 3.5h3l1.5 4-2 1.5a11.5 11.5 0 0 0 5 5l1.5-2 4 1.5v3c0 1.1-.9 2-2 2C10.2 18.5 5.5 13.8 5.5 6.5c0-1.1.9-2 1-3z"
                  stroke="currentColor"
                  stroke-width="1.5"
                  stroke-linecap="round"
                  stroke-linejoin="round"
